SUMMARY:Arknights: Endfield "Sanctuary of Ink" Version Preview Special Program
DESCRIPTION:Publisher GRYPHLINE and developer Mountain Contour will host the Arknights: Endfield “Sanctuary of Ink” Version Preview Special Program on October 6 at 4:30 a.m. PT / 7:30 a.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube (English\, Japanese\, Korean\, Traditional Chinese). \n“Ink breathes across the scroll\, while clouds and waters drift through open space. Endministrator\, brush and ink await. Unfurl the scroll and step into a painted sanctuary where body and mind can find repose.”
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/arknights-endfield-sanctuary-of-ink-version-preview-special-program
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_Arknights-Endfield_10-06-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
