SUMMARY:Fate/EXTRA Record Times: October 15\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:TYPE-MOON will host Fate/EXTRA Record Times on September 15 at 20:00 JST. You will be able to watch it on YouTube. \nThe broadcast will feature the latest information on Fate/EXTRA Record. Presenters include protagonist voice actors Atsushi Abe and Yui Ishikawa.
