SUMMARY:Galaxies Autumn 2026
DESCRIPTION:Galaxies Autumn 2026 will air on October 15 at 12:00 p.m. PT / 3:00 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube and Twitch. \nThe broadcast will feature world premieres\, major announcements\, and exclusive trailers for over 50 games.
